{"game": "roboquest", "language": "english", "appid": 692890, "month": "2024-10", "window": 4, "start_date": 1729728000, "end_date": 1730419199, "month_true_total": 204, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-03 01:54:20 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "178126579", "author": {"steamid": "76561198083479537", "personaname": "Unreal Nipples", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/snoobyslappedahoe/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 3809, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 147, "playtime_at_review": 2609, "last_played": 1790560113, "avatar": "53c5047805cd7299a6306372f742261612b34fa4"}, "language": "english", "review": "10/10\r\n\r\nListen here, Bro Bot. This game has become my first stop for high octane, fast paste, rouge-like shooters.\r\n\r\nThis has elements of all the best we've come to know and love but remains unique. Good solid progression that is still rewarding me at almost 50 hours. Different classes that have many different viable builds to experiment with. The game is a stand alone character, the art style is nothing new to the indie scene, but with it's flow, sound design, combat and game play it truly feels unique.\r\n\r\nSound track is a bop, we've got WuB WuB mixed with electric guitar. Weapons are cool and plentiful with explosives, bullets, lasers, melee and more.\r\n\r\nI could go on and on, so I'll just say that if you're a fan of even one of the tags the game has, it does it well and is worth a purchase.", "timestamp_created": 1730413778, "timestamp_updated": 1730413778, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "timestamp_dev_responded": 1730710923, "developer_response": "Thanks Unreal Nipples :)", "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "178113008", "author": {"steamid": "76561198025444929", "personaname": "s_kasia_s", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198025444929/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 442, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 442, "last_played": 1728914928, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "realy good game.you can do a lot of trikshots and it's veary cartoony\n", "timestamp_created": 1730398246, "timestamp_updated": 1730398246, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.526217222213745117", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "178109469", "author": {"steamid": "76561199092032372", "personaname": "Isotropic", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199092032372/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 31, "playtime_forever": 2396, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 702, "last_played": 1742346989, "avatar": "22440c345d7bc45b6ef39a5ce3c01178f031fc21"}, "language": "english", "review": "very good \r\nguns are way to fun esesaly roket jumping \r\nfast never boring just action", "timestamp_created": 1730394344, "timestamp_updated": 1730394344, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "178108519", "author": {"steamid": "76561198032648533", "personaname": "Dylan", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/obeyauthority/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 75, "playtime_forever": 4900, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4648, "deck_playtime_at_review": 137, "last_played": 1765124920, "avatar": "c417043f7963f14864c1fed6314e656c31418ccb"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is a fantastic game.  Great art style, very challenging but engaging, good build variety and multiple paths to take in runs.  Bosses are fun, there are some fun secrets to figure out.  It just really feels like someone put a lot of care and polish into it.  Highly highly recommend", "timestamp_created": 1730393263, "timestamp_updated": 1735761300, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "178092941", "author": {"steamid": "76561197970488516", "personaname": "jesterbot", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/thejesterbot/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 52, "playtime_forever": 5367, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 501, "last_played": 1732754513, "avatar": "8dfe278c7493b6984540e57ecd57b791df13841e"}, "language": "english", "review": "Honestly a pretty fun little FPS roguelite with an interesting blend of styles:\r\n\r\nVisuals: Borderlands-esque (very much so)\r\nMovement/Gunplay: Quake 3 Arena-esque (read: fast+fluid)\r\n\r\nThe progression/perks are pretty fun and varied enough that keeps you hunting for broken synergies, and the arenas are hard enough that you'll want them!  Overall, easily recommended for a casual play.\r\n", "timestamp_created": 1730376498, "timestamp_updated": 1730376498, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}]}